# The runtime cache no longer defaults into the checkout (it lives in the
# per-user cache dir or at $APKAUDIO_MAC_CACHE); these stay ignored in case an
# older build or a hand run put one here. The tracked, read-only seed is
# SRC/mac_vendors.seed.tsv (compiled in).
SRC/mac_vendors.tsv
SRC/mac_vendors.tsv.*
# A standalone `cargo check` writes this; the image builds from the engine's lock (PLAN-3397.01).
/SRC/Cargo.lock
